{"id":"n22674-1-8","stage":5,"title":"고생스럽다 · 苦","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n22674-1-8-1","ko":"요즘 회사 생활 어때?","zh":"最近公司的工作怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子。","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}},{"text":"회사","meaning":"公司，企业，会社","explanation":"회사：公司，企业，会社。","readings":[{"term":"회사","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31668","senseId":"1","lemma":"회사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"회사","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3"}},{"text":"생활","meaning":"生活","explanation":"생활：生活。","readings":[{"term":"생활","audio":"/audio/6a739e74f8dfb7fbc5ec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74183","senseId":"3","lemma":"생활","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생활","audio":"/audio/6a739e74f8dfb7fbc5ec.mp3"}},{"text":"어때?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어때","audio":"/audio/b8638c1eedbc8ab7e09d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"a109dcd7f6f11c2e","term":"회사","zh":"公司，企业，会社","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3","entryId":"31668","definition":"想要通过事业获得利益的许多人一起建立的法人团体。","pronunciation":["회ː사","훼ː사"]},{"id":"6a739e74f8dfb7fb","term":"생활","zh":"生活","audio":"/audio/6a739e74f8dfb7fbc5ec.mp3","entryId":"74183","definition":"作为某组织的一员进行活动。","pronunciation":["생활"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/4dfc1abf6198071fb13e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n22674-1-8-2","ko":"일이 많아서 고생스럽지만 보람도 많이 느껴서 전반적으로 만족스러워.","zh":"工作虽然很多，让人很辛苦，但也能感受到很多成就感，总体来说还是挺满意的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"일이","meaning":"事情，工作","explanation":"일：事情，工作；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"1","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일이","audio":"/audio/deca3bc3889d43a361ec.mp3"}},{"text":"많아서","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많아서","audio":"/audio/6a9e779aed8b5a8b02ab.mp3"}},{"text":"고생스럽지만","meaning":"苦，辛苦，艰苦","explanation":"고생스럽다：苦，辛苦，艰苦；지만：表示转折或让步：“但是、虽然”。","readings":[{"term":"고생스럽다","audio":"/audio/300c787bd91dee75061f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22674","senseId":"1","lemma":"고생스럽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고생스럽지만","audio":"/audio/852af7259fb27f4d4884.mp3"}},{"text":"보람도","meaning":"意义","explanation":"보람：意义；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"보람","audio":"/audio/39b3039cb7767155328b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58725","senseId":"1","lemma":"보람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보람도","audio":"/audio/cf1f518fbafcd835d9c7.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多。","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"느껴서","meaning":"感受，觉得，感到","explanation":"느끼다：感受，觉得，感到